        "paragraphs": [
            "MiniMax is the developer of the MiniMax family of AI models. The family covers text, video, speech, image, and music. MiniMax says the MiniMax-M3 is a frontier multimodal coding model with a 1M context window, and MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview is a frontier multimodal coding model with a 1M context window and tunable thinking depth. The text line also includes MiniMax-M2.7, MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed, MiniMax-M2.5, MiniMax-M2.5-highspeed, MiniMax-M2.1, MiniMax-M2.1-highspeed, and MiniMax-M2. MiniMax says MiniMax-M2.1 offers significantly enhanced multi-language programming for real-world complex tasks, and MiniMax-M2 provides agentic capabilities and advanced reasoning.",
            "Beyond text, the family includes MiniMax H3 and MiniMax H3 Max for video generation, MiniMax ASR for speech-to-text, speech models for voice cloning, MiniMax Music 3 for music generation, and an Image Generation service with text-to-image and image-to-image. MiniMax offers the models through its API, with an Anthropic SDK, an OpenAI SDK, and an AI SDK. MiniMax also documents running and self-hosting MiniMax-M3, MiniMax-M2.7, MiniMax Music 3, and MiniMax H3, and states that MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview is available only through M Plan and MiniMax Code for now."
        ],
